om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347800/extras/a6964140d1d40631f3a9f43dd2bbf10b.webm?t=1773693849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347800/extras/a6964140d1d40631f3a9f43dd2bbf10b.mp4?t=1773693849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Face challenging foes</strong><br>Combat the fungal aliens and metal husks of Lorian with responsiveness and precision. Level up your power, and customize your suit and blaster with an arsenal of modules.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347800/extras/b84bd3bdadb8beb25f2b1b10176fbf03.poster.avif?t=1773693849\" width=594 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347800/extras/b84bd3bdadb8beb25f2b1b10176fbf03.webm?t=1773693849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347800/extras/b84bd3bdadb8beb25f2b1b10176fbf03.mp4?t=1773693849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Blast and smash</strong><br>Master the distinctive rhythm of Deadsuit’s core combat. Pummel enemies with your rapid-fire blaster, building up barrel heat that empowers your melee attacks.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347800/extras/2f0532f35d2ae9c408a73bdf74ac2368.poster.avif?t=1773693849\" width=594 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347800/extras/2f0532f35d2ae9c408a73bdf74ac2368.webm?t=1773693849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347800/extras/2f0532f35d2ae9c408a73bdf74ac2368.mp4?t=1773693849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>